{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12982","headline":"和张大夫秋日有怀呈院中诸公 · 独孤及","name":"和张大夫秋日有怀呈院中诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至公无暇日，高阁闭秋天。\n肘印拘王事，篱花思长年。\n绩成心不有，虑澹物犹牵。\n窃效泉鱼跃，因闻郢曲妍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}